<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS2" title="In Appendix C Additional Experiments and Details ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.2 </span>Synthetic Experiments</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS3" title="In Appendix C Additional Experiments and Details ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.3 </span>Real-data Experiments</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
