<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\beta\mathbf{Z}_{t-1}+(1-\beta)\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{t}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{t,i})," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>B</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>Q</mi></msup><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>Q</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝃</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\beta\mathbf{Z}_{t-1}+(1-\beta)\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{t}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{t,i}),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbf{Z}_{0}=\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{0}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{0,i})." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>B</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>Q</mi></msup><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐖</mi><mn>0</mn><mi>Q</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝃</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbf{Z}_{0}=\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{0}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{0,i}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(B.5)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">We also define the following relative quantization errors <math id="A2.SS1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q_{G},q_{W},q_{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>G</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>W</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>M</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{G},q_{W},q_{M}</annotation></semantics></math> according to Assumption <a href="#S3.Thmtheorem1" title="Assumption 3.1 (Quantization Error). ‣ Relative error. ‣ 3.1 Preliminaries ‣ 3 Preliminaries and Problem Setup ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.1</span></a> and Lemma <a href="#A2.Thmtheorem2" title="Lemma B.2. ‣ B.4 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix B Proof of Theorem ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.2</span></a>, i.e., for any <math id="A2.SS1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in\{0,1,\ldots,T-1\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in\{0,1,\ldots,T-1\}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A2.SS1.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in\{1,2,\ldots,B\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in\{1,2,\ldots,B\}</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
<table id="A2.EGx153" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex1"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\|\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{t};\bm{\xi}_{t,i})-\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{t};\bm{\xi}_{t,i})\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>Q</mi></msup><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝃</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝃</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\|\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{t};\bm{\xi}_{t,i})-\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{t};\bm{\xi}_{t,i})\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq q_{G}\|\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{t};\bm{\xi}_{t,i})\|_{F}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>G</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝃</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq q_{G}\|\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{t};\bm{\xi}_{t,i})\|_{F},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
