</table>
<p id="A2.SS7.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS7.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text">The second inequality is due to Assumption <a href="#S3.Thmtheorem1" title="Assumption 3.1 (Quantization Error). ‣ Relative error. ‣ 3.1 Preliminaries ‣ 3 Preliminaries and Problem Setup ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.1</span></a>, Lemma <a href="#A2.Thmtheorem2" title="Lemma B.2. ‣ B.4 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix B Proof of Theorem ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.2</span></a> and Definition <a href="#A2.Ex1" title="In B.1 Preliminaries ‣ Appendix B Proof of Theorem ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.6</span></a>. The third inequality is due to Assumption <a href="#S4.Thmtheorem2" title="Assumption 4.2 (Stochastic Gradient Bounds). ‣ 4 Main Results ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.2</span></a>. The fourth inequality is due to Lemma <a href="#A2.Thmtheorem1" title="Lemma B.1 (Bound of ‖𝐖‖_𝐹 and ‖∇𝐹⁢(𝐖)‖_𝐹 for Muon). ‣ B.3 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix B Proof of Theorem ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.1</span></a>.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS8" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.8 </span>Proof of Lemma <a href="#A2.Thmtheorem6" title="Lemma B.6. ‣ B.8 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix B Proof of Theorem ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.6</span></a></h3>

<div id="A2.Thmtheorem6" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A2.Thmtheorem6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma B.6</span></span><span id="A2.Thmtheorem6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A2.Thmtheorem6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.Thmtheorem6.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.Thmtheorem6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Suppose Assumptions <a href="#S4.Thmtheorem1" title="Assumption 4.1 (Unbiased Stochastic Gradient). ‣ 4 Main Results ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.1</span></a>, <a href="#S4.Thmtheorem2" title="Assumption 4.2 (Stochastic Gradient Bounds). ‣ 4 Main Results ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.2</span></a>, <a href="#S4.Thmtheorem3" title="Assumption 4.3 (Smoothness). ‣ 4 Main Results ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.3</span></a> and <a href="#S3.Thmtheorem1" title="Assumption 3.1 (Quantization Error). ‣ Relative error. ‣ 3.1 Preliminaries ‣ 3 Preliminaries and Problem Setup ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.1</span></a> hold. For any <math id="A2.Thmtheorem6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A2.EGx175" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex84"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex84.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[\|\mathbf{Y}_{t}-\mathbf{Z}_{t}\|_{F}]\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐘</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[\|\mathbf{Y}_{t}-\mathbf{Z}_{t}\|_{F}]\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex84.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\beta^{t}\cdot\frac{2\sigma}{\sqrt{B}}+\sqrt{\frac{1-\beta}{1+\beta}}\cdot\frac{2\sigma}{\sqrt{B}}+2q_{G}(\sigma+G)+2q_{G}t\eta\sqrt{r}L+" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>σ</mi></mrow><msqrt><mi>B</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>σ</mi></mrow><msqrt><mi>B</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>G</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>G</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>r</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\beta^{t}\cdot\frac{2\sigma}{\sqrt{B}}+\sqrt{\frac{1-\beta}{1+\beta}}\cdot\frac{2\sigma}{\sqrt{B}}+2q_{G}(\sigma+G)+2q_{G}t\eta\sqrt{r}L+</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex85"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex85.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle q_{W}(1+q_{G})DL+q_{W}(1+q_{G})t\eta\sqrt{r}L," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>W</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>G</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>W</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>G</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>r</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle q_{W}(1+q_{G})DL+q_{W}(1+q_{G})t\eta\sqrt{r}L,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex86"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex86.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[\|\mathbf{Z}_{t}\|_{F}]\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[\|\mathbf{Z}_{t}\|_{F}]\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex86.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{\sigma}{\sqrt{B}}+\sqrt{\frac{1-\beta}{1+\beta}}\cdot\frac{\sigma}{\sqrt{B}}+G+q_{G}(\sigma+G)+q_{W}(1+q_{G})DL+" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>σ</mi><msqrt><mi>B</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mrow><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>σ</mi><msqrt><mi>B</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>G</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>W</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>G</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{\sigma}{\sqrt{B}}+\sqrt{\frac{1-\beta}{1+\beta}}\cdot\frac{\sigma}{\sqrt{B}}+G+q_{G}(\sigma+G)+q_{W}(1+q_{G})DL+</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex87"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex87.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(1+q_{W})(1+q_{G})t\eta\sqrt{r}L." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>W</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>G</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>r</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(1+q_{W})(1+q_{G})t\eta\sqrt{r}L.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS8.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof of Lemma <a href="#A2.Thmtheorem6" title="Lemma B.6. ‣ B.8 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix B Proof of Theorem ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.6</span></a>.</h6>
<div id="A2.SS8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS8.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS8.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text">By the definition of <math id="A2.SS8.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{Y}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐘</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{Y}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A2.SS8.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{Z}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{Z}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> in (<a href="#A2.E4" title="In B.1 Preliminaries ‣ Appendix B Proof of Theorem ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.4</span></a>) and (<a href="#A2.E5" title="In B.1 Preliminaries ‣ Appendix B Proof of Theorem ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.5</span></a>), we have</span></p>
<table id="A2.EGx176" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex88"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex88.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbf{Y}_{t}=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐘</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbf{Y}_{t}=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex88.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\beta^{t}\mathbf{Y}_{0}+(1-\beta)\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{k};\bm{\xi}_{k,i})," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐘</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msup><mi>β</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>B</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>Q</mi></msup><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝃</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\beta^{t}\mathbf{Y}_{0}+(1-\beta)\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{k};\bm{\xi}_{k,i}),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex89"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex89.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbf{Z}_{t}=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbf{Z}_{t}=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex89.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\beta^{t}\mathbf{Z}_{0}+(1-\beta)\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{k,i})." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msup><mi>β</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>B</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>Q</mi></msup><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>Q</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝃</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\beta^{t}\mathbf{Z}_{0}+(1-\beta)\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{k,i}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS8.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS8.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text">Thus, by the triangle inequality, we have</span></p>
<table id="A2.EGx177" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex90"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex90.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[\|\mathbf{Y}_{t}-\mathbf{Z}_{t}\|_{F}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐘</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[\|\mathbf{Y}_{t}-\mathbf{Z}_{t}\|_{F}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex91"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex91.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex91.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[\beta^{t}\|\mathbf{Y}_{0}-\mathbf{Z}_{0}\|_{F}]+(1-\beta)\mathbb{E}[\|\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\cdot(\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{k};\bm{\xi}_{k,i})-\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{k,i}))\|_{F}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐘</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><msup><mi>β</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>B</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>Q</mi></msup><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝃</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>Q</mi></msup><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>Q</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝃</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[\beta^{t}\|\mathbf{Y}_{0}-\mathbf{Z}_{0}\|_{F}]+(1-\beta)\mathbb{E}[\|\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\cdot(\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{k};\bm{\xi}_{k,i})-\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{k,i}))\|_{F}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex92"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex92.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex92.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[\beta^{t}\|\mathbf{Y}_{0}-\mathbf{Z}_{0}\|_{F}]+\underbrace{(1-\beta)\mathbb{E}[\|\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\cdot(\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{k};\bm{\xi}_{k,i})-\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{k};\bm{\xi}_{k,i})\|_{F}]}_{\text{\large A}}+" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐘</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msup><mi>β</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>B</mi></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>Q</mi></msup><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐖</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>;</mo><mi>𝝃</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐖</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>;</mo><mi>𝝃</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext mathsize="1.710em">A</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[\beta^{t}\|\mathbf{Y}_{0}-\mathbf{Z}_{0}\|_{F}]+\underbrace{(1-\beta)\mathbb{E}[\|\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\cdot(\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{k};\bm{\xi}_{k,i})-\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{k};\bm{\xi}_{k,i})\|_{F}]}_{\text{\large A}}+</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex93"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex93.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\underbrace{(1-\beta)\mathbb{E}[\|\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\cdot(\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{k};\bm{\xi}_{k,i})-\nabla F(\mathbf{W}_{k}))\|_{F}]}_{\text{\large C}}+" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><msup><mi>β</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>B</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝃</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext mathsize="1.710em">C</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\underbrace{(1-\beta)\mathbb{E}[\|\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\cdot(\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{k};\bm{\xi}_{k,i})-\nabla F(\mathbf{W}_{k}))\|_{F}]}_{\text{\large C}}+</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex94"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex94.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\underbrace{(1-\beta)\mathbb{E}[\|\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\cdot(\nabla F(\mathbf{W}_{k})-\nabla F(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q}))\|_{F}]}_{\text{\large H}}+" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><msup><mi>β</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>Q</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext mathsize="1.710em">H</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\underbrace{(1-\beta)\mathbb{E}[\|\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\cdot(\nabla F(\mathbf{W}_{k})-\nabla F(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q}))\|_{F}]}_{\text{\large H}}+</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex95"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex95.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\underbrace{(1-\beta)\mathbb{E}[\|\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\cdot(\nabla F(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q})-\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{k,i}))\|_{F}]}_{\text{\large I}}+" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><msup><mi>β</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>Q</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>B</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>Q</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝃</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext mathsize="1.710em">I</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\underbrace{(1-\beta)\mathbb{E}[\|\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\cdot(\nabla F(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q})-\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{k,i}))\|_{F}]}_{\text{\large I}}+</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.E10"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\underbrace{(1-\beta)\mathbb{E}[\|\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\cdot(\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{k,i})-\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{k,i}))\|_{F}]}_{\text{\large J}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><msup><mi>β</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>B</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>Q</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝃</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>Q</mi></msup><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>Q</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝃</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext mathsize="1.710em">J</mtext></munder><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\underbrace{(1-\beta)\mathbb{E}[\|\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\cdot(\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{k,i})-\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{k,i}))\|_{F}]}_{\text{\large J}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(B.10)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS8.p1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS8.p1.3.1" class="ltx_text">Next, we bound each term in (<a href="#A2.Ex90" title="In Proof of Lemma . ‣ B.8 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix B Proof of Theorem ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.10</span></a>) one by one.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<section id="A2.SS8.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Bound on <math id="A2.SS8.SSS0.Px1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta^{t}\mathbb{E}[\|\mathbf{Y}_{0}-\mathbf{Z}_{0}\|_{F}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐘</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta^{t}\mathbb{E}[\|\mathbf{Y}_{0}-\mathbf{Z}_{0}\|_{F}]</annotation></semantics></math>.</h4>

<div id="A2.SS8.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS8.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">By the definitions of <math id="A2.SS8.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{Y}_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐘</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{Y}_{0}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A2.SS8.SSS0.Px1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{Z}_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{Z}_{0}</annotation></semantics></math> in (<a href="#A2.E4" title="In B.1 Preliminaries ‣ Appendix B Proof of Theorem ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.4</span></a>) and (<a href="#A2.E5" title="In B.1 Preliminaries ‣ Appendix B Proof of Theorem ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.5</span></a>), we have</p>
<table id="A2.EGx178" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex96"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex96.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbf{Y}_{0}=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐘</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbf{Y}_{0}=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex96.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{0};\bm{\xi}_{0,i})," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>B</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>Q</mi></msup><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝃</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{0};\bm{\xi}_{0,i}),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex97"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex97.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbf{Z}_{0}=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbf{Z}_{0}=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex97.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{0}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{0,i})." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>B</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>Q</mi></msup><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐖</mi><mn>0</mn><mi>Q</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝃</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{0}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{0,i}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS8.SSS0.Px1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">Thus, we have</p>
<table id="A2.EGx179" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex98"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex98.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\beta^{t}\mathbb{E}[\|\mathbf{Y}_{0}-\mathbf{Z}_{0}\|_{F}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐘</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐙</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\beta^{t}\mathbb{E}[\|\mathbf{Y}_{0}-\mathbf{Z}_{0}\|_{F}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex99"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex99.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex99.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\beta^{t}\mathbb{E}[\|\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{0};\bm{\xi}_{0,i})-\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{0}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{0,i})\|_{F}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>B</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>Q</mi></msup><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝃</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>B</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>Q</mi></msup><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐖</mi><mn>0</mn><mi>Q</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝃</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\beta^{t}\mathbb{E}[\|\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{0};\bm{\xi}_{0,i})-\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{0}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{0,i})\|_{F}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
