row></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\beta^{t}\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}q_{G}(\sigma+G)+\beta^{t}\frac{2\sigma}{\sqrt{B}}+\beta^{t}q_{W}DL+\beta^{t}\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}q_{G}(\sigma+q_{W}DL+G)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
