<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(B.11)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS8.SSS0.Px1.p1.3" class="ltx_p">The first inequality is due to the triangle inequality. The second inequality we used Definition <a href="#A2.Ex1" title="In B.1 Preliminaries ‣ Appendix B Proof of Theorem ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.6</span></a> for the first and last terms, Assumption <a href="#S4.Thmtheorem1" title="Assumption 4.1 (Unbiased Stochastic Gradient). ‣ 4 Main Results ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.1</span></a>, <a href="#S4.Thmtheorem2" title="Assumption 4.2 (Stochastic Gradient Bounds). ‣ 4 Main Results ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.2</span></a> and Jensen’s inequality for the second and fourth terms, and Assumption <a href="#S4.Thmtheorem3" title="Assumption 4.3 (Smoothness). ‣ 4 Main Results ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.3</span></a> and Definition <a href="#A2.Ex1" title="In B.1 Preliminaries ‣ Appendix B Proof of Theorem ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.6</span></a> for the third term. The third inequality is due to Assumption <a href="#S4.Thmtheorem2" title="Assumption 4.2 (Stochastic Gradient Bounds). ‣ 4 Main Results ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.2</span></a>, <a href="#S4.Thmtheorem4" title="Assumption 4.4 (Bounded Initialization). ‣ 4 Main Results ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.4</span></a> and Definition <a href="#A2.Ex1" title="In B.1 Preliminaries ‣ Appendix B Proof of Theorem ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.6</span></a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS8.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Bound on <span id="A2.SS8.SSS0.Px2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:120%;">A</span>.</h4>

<div id="A2.SS8.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A2.EGx180" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex108"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex108.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle A=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle A=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex108.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle(1-\beta)\mathbb{E}[\|\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\cdot(\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{k};\bm{\xi}_{k,i})-\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{k};\bm{\xi}_{k,i})\|_{F}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><msup><mi>β</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>B</mi></munderover></mstyle><msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>Q</mi></msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>𝝃</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>𝝃</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mi>F</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(1-\beta)\mathbb{E}[\|\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\cdot(\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{k};\bm{\xi}_{k,i})-\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{k};\bm{\xi}_{k,i})\|_{F}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex109"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex109.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex109.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(1-\beta)\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}q_{G}\mathbb{E}[\|\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{k};\bm{\xi}_{k,i})\|_{F}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msup><mi>β</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>B</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>G</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝃</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(1-\beta)\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}q_{G}\mathbb{E}[\|\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{k};\bm{\xi}_{k,i})\|_{F}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex110"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex110.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex110.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(1-\beta)\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}q_{G}(\sigma+\mathbb{E}[\|\nabla F(\mathbf{W}_{k})\|_{F}])" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msup><mi>β</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>B</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>G</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(1-\beta)\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}q_{G}(\sigma+\mathbb{E}[\|\nabla F(\mathbf{W}_{k})\|_{F}])</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex111"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex111.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex111.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(1-\beta)\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}q_{G}(\sigma+G+t\eta\sqrt{r}L)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msup><mi>β</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>B</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>G</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>r</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(1-\beta)\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}q_{G}(\sigma+G+t\eta\sqrt{r}L)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.E12"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E12.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(1-\beta^{t})q_{G}(\sigma+G+t\eta\sqrt{r}L)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>G</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>r</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(1-\beta^{t})q_{G}(\sigma+G+t\eta\sqrt{r}L).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(B.12)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS8.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The first inequality is due to Definition <a href="#A2.Ex1" title="In B.1 Preliminaries ‣ Appendix B Proof of Theorem ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.6</span></a> and the triangle inequality. The second inequality is due to Assumption <a href="#S4.Thmtheorem2" title="Assumption 4.2 (Stochastic Gradient Bounds). ‣ 4 Main Results ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.2</span></a>. The third inequality is due to Lemma <a href="#A2.Thmtheorem1" title="Lemma B.1 (Bound of ‖𝐖‖_𝐹 and ‖∇𝐹⁢(𝐖)‖_𝐹 for Muon). ‣ B.3 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix B Proof of Theorem ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.1</span></a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS8.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Bound on <span id="A2.SS8.SSS0.Px3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:120%;">C</span>.</h4>

<div id="A2.SS8.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS8.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Similar to Lemma <a href="#A2.Thmtheorem4" title="Lemma B.4. ‣ B.6 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix B Proof of Theorem ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.4</span></a>, we have</p>
<table id="A2.EGx181" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex112"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex112.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle C=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle C=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex112.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(1-\beta)\mathbb{E}[\|\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\cdot(\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{k};\bm{\xi}_{k,i})-\nabla F(\mathbf{W}_{k}))\|_{F}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><msup><mi>β</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>B</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝃</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(1-\beta)\mathbb{E}[\|\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\cdot(\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{k};\bm{\xi}_{k,i})-\nabla F(\mathbf{W}_{k}))\|_{F}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex113"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex113.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex113.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(1-\beta)\sqrt{\mathbb{E}[\|\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\cdot(\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{k};\bm{\xi}_{k,i})-\nabla F(\mathbf{W}_{k}))\|_{F}^{2}]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><msup><mi>β</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>B</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝃</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(1-\beta)\sqrt{\mathbb{E}[\|\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\cdot(\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{k};\bm{\xi}_{k,i})-\nabla F(\mathbf{W}_{k}))\|_{F}^{2}]}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
