<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E14.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(1-\beta^{t})q_{W}L(D+t\eta\sqrt{r})." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>W</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi>r</mi></msqrt></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(1-\beta^{t})q_{W}L(D+t\eta\sqrt{r}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(B.14)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS8.SSS0.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The first inequality is due to the triangle inequality. The second inequality is due to Assumption <a href="#S4.Thmtheorem3" title="Assumption 4.3 (Smoothness). ‣ 4 Main Results ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.3</span></a>. The third inequality is due to Definition <a href="#A2.Ex1" title="In B.1 Preliminaries ‣ Appendix B Proof of Theorem ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.6</span></a>. The fourth inequality is due to Lemma <a href="#A2.Thmtheorem1" title="Lemma B.1 (Bound of ‖𝐖‖_𝐹 and ‖∇𝐹⁢(𝐖)‖_𝐹 for Muon). ‣ B.3 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix B Proof of Theorem ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.1</span></a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS8.SSS0.Px5" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Bound on <span id="A2.SS8.SSS0.Px5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:120%;">I</span>.</h4>

<div id="A2.SS8.SSS0.Px5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS8.SSS0.Px5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Similar to Lemma <a href="#A2.Thmtheorem4" title="Lemma B.4. ‣ B.6 Proof of Lemma ‣ Appendix B Proof of Theorem ‣ A Convergence Analysis of Adaptive Optimizers under Floating-point Quantization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.4</span></a>, we have</p>
<table id="A2.EGx183" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex122"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex122.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle I=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle I=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex122.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(1-\beta)\mathbb{E}[\|\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\cdot(\nabla F(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q})-\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{k,i}))\|_{F}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><msup><mi>β</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>Q</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>B</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>Q</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝃</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(1-\beta)\mathbb{E}[\|\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\cdot(\nabla F(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q})-\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{k,i}))\|_{F}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex123"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex123.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex123.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(1-\beta)\sqrt{\mathbb{E}[\|\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\cdot(\nabla F(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q})-\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{k,i}))\|_{F}^{2}]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><msup><mi>β</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>Q</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>B</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>Q</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝃</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(1-\beta)\sqrt{\mathbb{E}[\|\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\cdot(\nabla F(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q})-\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{k,i}))\|_{F}^{2}]}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex124"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex124.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex124.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(1-\beta)\sqrt{\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{2(t-k)}\frac{1}{B^{2}}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\mathbb{E}[\|\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{k,i})-\nabla F(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q})\|_{F}^{2}]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msup><mi>β</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>B</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>Q</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝃</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>Q</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(1-\beta)\sqrt{\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{2(t-k)}\frac{1}{B^{2}}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\mathbb{E}[\|\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{k,i})-\nabla F(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q})\|_{F}^{2}]}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex125"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex125.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex125.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(1-\beta)\sqrt{\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{2(t-k)}\frac{1}{B^{2}}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\sigma^{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msup><mi>β</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>B</mi></munderover></mstyle><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(1-\beta)\sqrt{\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{2(t-k)}\frac{1}{B^{2}}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\sigma^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex126"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex126.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex126.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(1-\beta)\sqrt{\frac{1-\beta^{2t}}{1-\beta^{2}}\cdot\frac{\sigma^{2}}{B}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(1-\beta)\sqrt{\frac{1-\beta^{2t}}{1-\beta^{2}}\cdot\frac{\sigma^{2}}{B}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.E15"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E15.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sqrt{\frac{1-\beta}{1+\beta}}\cdot\frac{\sigma}{\sqrt{B}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>σ</mi><msqrt><mi>B</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sqrt{\frac{1-\beta}{1+\beta}}\cdot\frac{\sigma}{\sqrt{B}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(B.15)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS8.SSS0.Px6" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Bound on <span id="A2.SS8.SSS0.Px6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:120%;">J</span>.</h4>

<div id="A2.SS8.SSS0.Px6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A2.EGx184" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex127"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex127.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle J=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle J=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex127.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(1-\beta)\mathbb{E}[\|\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\cdot(\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{k,i})-\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{k,i}))\|_{F}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><msup><mi>β</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>B</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>Q</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝃</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>Q</mi></msup><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>Q</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝃</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(1-\beta)\mathbb{E}[\|\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\cdot(\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{k,i})-\nabla^{Q}f(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{k,i}))\|_{F}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex128"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex128.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex128.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(1-\beta)\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}q_{G}\mathbb{E}[\|\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{k,i})\|_{F}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msup><mi>β</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>B</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>G</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐖</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>Q</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝝃</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(1-\beta)\sum_{k=1}^{t}\beta^{t-k}\frac{1}{B}\sum_{i=1}^{B}q_{G}\mathbb{E}[\|\nabla f(\mathbf{W}_{k}^{Q};\bm{\xi}_{k,i})\|_{F}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
